# Personnel example #3: Job Details Modal, completed 2026-10-22.
# Base: main at 6cf26319ab2f8b89706677ccfacd83fddb2de46b.
# Based on example #1 Reverse Accordion with all inline expansion removed.
# One shared header row; funding distributions and their totals are always shown.
# Clicking an employee or any of their funding rows opens a native dialog.
# The employee button also opens the dialog with Enter or Space.
# Dialog includes employee ID, job code/description, FTE, job dates,
# and full position monthly salary, CBR, and total.
# The dialog closes via Close, X, backdrop, or Escape and locks body scrolling.
# FE Start / FE End keep the shared UC Path tooltip definitions.
# Parenthesis-specific presentation and explanation are not active.
# Restore selectively against subsequent edits rather than blindly applying.

